                "text": "$u(t)-u(t-3)$ is $1$ on $0\\le t<3$ and $0$ elsewhere, so the pulse lives on $[0,3)$. Squaring the amplitude gives $|6|^2=36$, so the energy setup is just the integral of $36$ over that support.",
